{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Single source of truth for attacker units. The game and the balance simulator both read this file.",
    "Numbers are starting values for balancing. Fields listed in a unit's 'proposed' array were not specified by Yaroslav and are Claude's suggestions.",
    "Speeds are game speeds in m/s on open field at 1x (infantry run at 4x real walking pace). Terrain move cost divides speed.",
    "Damage is per second of fire while the target is visible and in range, before accuracy, armour and cover.",
    "Our FPV is tuned so about 3 hits destroy the armoured patrol vehicle (60 HP, high armour: 40% of each hit)."
  ],
